msgstr "Opgaven archiveren"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:39
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:340 rc.cpp:1287
msgid "Regularly archive events"
msgstr "Begeefnissen automaatsch archiveren"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:43
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:343 rc.cpp:1290
msgid "What to do when archiving"
msgstr "Archiveer-Akschoon"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:46
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:346 rc.cpp:1293
msgid "Delete old events"
msgstr "Ole Begeefnissen wegdoon"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:49
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:349 rc.cpp:1296
msgid "Archive old events to a separate file"
msgstr "Ole Begeefnissen in en Datei archiveren"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:55
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:352 rc.cpp:1299
msgid ""
"If auto-archiving is enabled, events older than this amount will be "
"archived. The unit of this value is specified in another field."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat automaatsche Archiveren anmaakt is, warrt Begeefnissen archiveert, "
"de öller sünd as disse Weert angifft. De Eenheit för den Weert kannst Du in "
"en anner Feld fastleggen."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:59
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ExpiryUnit), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:355 rc.cpp:1302
msgid "The unit in which the expiry time is expressed."
msgstr "De Eenheit för de Archiveer-Tietgrenz"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:62
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ExpiryUnit), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:358 rc.cpp:1305
msgid "In days"
msgstr "In Daag"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:65
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ExpiryUnit), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:361 rc.cpp:1308
msgid "In weeks"
msgstr "In Weken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:68
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ExpiryUnit), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:364 rc.cpp:1311
msgid "In months"
msgstr "In Maanden"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:74
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:367 rc.cpp:1314
msgid "URL of the file where old events should be archived"
msgstr "De Adress vun de Datei, na de de Begeefnissen archiveert warrt"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:78
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:370 rc.cpp:1317
msgid "Export to HTML with every save"
msgstr "Bi't Sekern jümmers na HTML exporteren"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:79
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:373 rc.cpp:1320
msgid ""
"Check this box to export the calendar to a HTML-file every time you save it. "
"By default, this file will be called calendar.html and placed in the user "
"home folder."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du den Kalenner jümmers as en HTML-Datei sekern wullt. "
"Standardwies warrt de Datei kalenner.html nöömt un steiht binnen Dien "
"Tohuusorner."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:83
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:376 rc.cpp:1323
msgid "New Events, To-dos and Journal Entries Should"
msgstr "Niege Begeefnissen, Opgaven un Daagbookindrääg"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:86
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:379 rc.cpp:1326
msgid "Be added to the standard resource"
msgstr "Na de Standardressource tofögen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:87
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Destination), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:382 rc.cpp:1329
msgid ""
"Select this option to always record new events, to-dos and journal entries "
"using the standard resource."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du niege Indrääg automaatsch binnen de Standardressource "
"sekern wullt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:90
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:385 rc.cpp:1332
msgid "Be asked which resource to use"
msgstr "Na Ressource fragen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:91
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Destination), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:388 rc.cpp:1335
msgid ""
"Select this option to choose the resource to be used to record the item each "
"time you create a new event, to-do or journal entry. This choice is "
"recommended if you intend to use the shared folders functionality of the "
"Kolab server or have to manage multiple accounts using Kontact as a KDE "
"Kolab client. "
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, fraagt KOrganizer Di jümmers na de Ressource, binnen de de "
"niege Indrag wohrt warrn schall, wenn Du en nieg Opgaav, Begeefnis oder "
"Daagbookindrag opstellst. Dit is anraadt, wenn Du de deelten Ornern op Kolab-"
"Servers bruken wullt oder mit Kontact as Client mehr as een Kolab-Konto "
"plegen muttst."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:98
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:391 rc.cpp:1338
msgid "Show Reminder Daemon in the System Tray"
msgstr "Anstootdämoon binnen Systeemafsnitt wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:99
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General)
#: rc.cpp:394 rc.cpp:1341
msgid ""
"Check this box to show the KOrganizer reminder daemon in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du den KOrganizer-Anstootdämoon binnen den Systeemafsnitt "
"wiesen wullt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:106
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:397 rc.cpp:1344
msgid "Send copy to owner when mailing events"
msgstr "Kopie vun Begeefnis-Nettbreven na Bruker sennen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:107
