"your request to event attendees."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du vun all Nettbreven, de KOrganizer för Di na Begeefnis-"
"Deelnehmers sendt, en Kopie kriegen wullt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:111
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EmailControlCenter), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:403 rc.cpp:1350
msgid "Use email settings from System Settings"
msgstr "Nettpostinstellen ut Systeeminstellen bruken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:112
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (EmailControlCenter), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:406 rc.cpp:1353
msgid ""
"Check this box to use the KDE-wide e-mail settings, which are defined using "
"the System Settings \"About Me\" Module. Uncheck this box to be able to "
"specify your full name and e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de KDE-Instellen för Nettpost bruken schall. De kannst "
"Du in de Systeeminstellen binnen dat \"Över mi\"-Moduul\"topassen. Wenn Du "
"dit nich anmaakst, kannst Du hier Dien Naam un Nettpostadress ingeven."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:116
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UserName), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:409 rc.cpp:1356
msgid "Full &name"
msgstr "&Heel Naam:"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:117
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UserName), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:412 rc.cpp:1359
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here. This name will be displayed as \"Organizer\" in "
"to-dos and events you create."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien helen Naam in. Disse Naam warrt as \"Utrichter\" för vun Di "
"opstellte Opgaven un Begeefnissen wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:121
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UserEmail), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:415 rc.cpp:1362
msgid "E&mail address"
msgstr "&Nettpostadress:"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:122
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UserEmail), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:418 rc.cpp:1365
msgid ""
"Enter here your e-mail address. This e-mail address will be used to identify "
"the owner of the calendar, and displayed in events and to-dos you create."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien Nettpostadress in. Över disse Adress warrt de Kalenner sien "
"Eegner toornt, un se warrt in vun Di opstellte Opgaven un Begeefnissen wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:126
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:421 rc.cpp:1368
msgid "Mail Client"
msgstr "Nettpost-Programm"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:129
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:424 rc.cpp:1371
msgid "KMail"
msgstr "KMail"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:130
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:427 rc.cpp:1374
msgid ""
"Select this option to use KMail as the mail transport. The mail transport is "
"used for groupware functionality."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du KMail för de Nettpost-Överdregen bruken wullt; de "
"Nettbreven warrt för de Arbeitkoppel-Funkschonen bruukt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:133
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:430 rc.cpp:1377
msgid "Sendmail"
msgstr "Sendmail"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:134
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:433 rc.cpp:1380
msgid ""
"Select this option to use sendmail as the mail transport. The mail transport "
"is used for groupware functionality. Please check if you have sendmail "
"installed before selecting this option."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du Sendmail för de Nettpost-Överdregen bruken wullt; "
"Nettbreven warrt för de Arbeitkoppel-Funkschonen bruukt. Prööv bitte, wat "
"Sendmail installeert is, ehr Du disse Optschoon anmaakst."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:143
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (TimeZoneId), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:436 rc.cpp:1383
msgid ""
"Select your timezone from the list of locations on this drop down box. If "
"your city is not listed, select one which shares the same timezone. "
"KOrganizer will automatically adjust for daylight savings."
msgstr ""
"Söök Dien Oort op de List vun Öörd binnen de Köör ut. Wenn Dien Stadt nich "
"oplist is, söök een binnen Dien Tietrebeet ut. KOrganizer stellt sik "
"automaatsch op Sommer- un Wintertiet in."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:146
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Holidays), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:439 rc.cpp:1386
msgid "Use holiday region:"
msgstr "Fierdagregioon bruken:"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:147
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Holidays), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:442 rc.cpp:1389
msgid ""
"Select from which region you want to use the holidays here. Defined holidays "
"are shown as non-working days in the date navigator, the agenda view, etc."
msgstr ""
"Söök ut, vun welk Regioon Du de Fierdaag bruken wullt. Fastleggte Fierdaag "
"warrt binnen de Datumnavigatschoon, de Dag-Ansicht usw. as fre'e Daag wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:150
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (StartTime), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:445 rc.cpp:1392
msgid "Default appointment time"
msgstr "Standardtiet för Terminen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:151
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (StartTime), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:448 rc.cpp:1395
msgid ""
"Enter the default time for events here. The default is used if you do not "
"supply a start time."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Standardtiet för Begeefnissen angeven. Wenn Du keen "
"Anfangtiet angiffst, warrt de Standardtiet nahmen."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:155
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultDuration), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:451 rc.cpp:1398
msgid "Default duration of new appointment (HH:MM)"
msgstr "Standardduer för niege Terminen (hh:mm)"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:156
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DefaultDuration), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:454 rc.cpp:1401
msgid ""
"Enter default duration for events here. The default is used if you do not "
"supply an end time."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du en Standardduer för Begeefnissen fastleggen. Se warrt bruukt, "
"wenn Du keen Enntiet angiffst."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:160
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AlarmTime), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:457 rc.cpp:1404
msgid "Default Reminder Time"
msgstr "Standardtiet för Vöranstööt"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:161
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AlarmTime), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:460 rc.cpp:1407
msgid "Enter the reminder time here."
msgstr "Giff hier de Standardtiet för Vöranstööt in"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:165
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowTimeZoneSelectorInIncidenceEditor), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:463 rc.cpp:1410
msgid "Show timezone selectors in the event and todo editor dialog."
msgstr "Tietrebeet-Köör binnen Begeefnis- un Opgaaveditor wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:172
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:466 rc.cpp:1413
msgid "Hour size"
msgstr "Grött vun een Stünn"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:173
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:469 rc.cpp:1416
msgid ""
"Select on this spin box the height of the hour rows in the schedule view."
msgstr ""
"Mit dit Dreihfeld kannst Du de Hööchde vun de Stünnregen in de Dagansicht "
"fastleggen."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:179
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DailyRecur), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:472 rc.cpp:1419
msgid "Show events that recur daily in date navigator"
msgstr "Begeefnissen mit Dag-Wedderhalen in Navigatschoon wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:180
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DailyRecur), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:475 rc.cpp:1422
msgid ""
"Check this box to show the days containing daily recurring events in bold "
"typeface in the Date Navigator, or uncheck it to give more prominence to "
"other (non daily recurring) events."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Daag mit Begeefnissen, de sik dagbaseert wedderhaalt, "
"binnen de Datumnavigatschoon mit fette Schrift markeert. Wenn Du dat "
"utmaakst, stickt anner Begeefnissen (ahn Dag-Wedderhalen) mehr rut."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:184
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WeeklyRecur), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:478 rc.cpp:1425
msgid "Show events that recur weekly in date navigator"
msgstr "Begeefnissen mit Week-Wedderhalen in Navigatschoon wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:185
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WeeklyRecur), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:481 rc.cpp:1428
msgid ""
"Check this box to show the days containing weekly recurring events in bold "
"typeface in the Date Navigator, or uncheck it to give more prominence to "
"other (non weekly recurring) events."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Daag mit Begeefnissen, de sik wekenbaseert wedderhaalt, "
"binnen de Datumnavigatschoon mit fette Schrift markeert. Wenn Du dat "
"utmaakst, stickt anner Begeefnissen (ahn Week-Wedderhalen) mehr rut."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:189
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:484 rc.cpp:1431
msgid "Enable tooltips for displaying summaries"
msgstr "Tosamenfaten binnen Kortinfos wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:190
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:487 rc.cpp:1434
msgid ""
"Check this box to display summary tooltips when hovering the mouse over an "
"event or a to-do."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du binnen de KortInformatschoon en Tosamenfaten vun dat "
"Begeefnis hebben wullt, op dat Du mit de Muus wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:194
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowAllDayTodo), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:490 rc.cpp:1437
msgid "Show to-dos in day, week and month views"
msgstr "Opgaven in Daag-, Weken- un Maandansicht wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:195
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ShowAllDayTodo), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:493 rc.cpp:1440
msgid ""
"Check this box to display to-dos in the day, week, and month view. This is "
"helpful when you have a lot of (recurring) to-dos."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du Opgaven binnen de Dag-, Week- un Maandansichten wiesen "
"wullt. Dat is goot, wenn Du en Barg (sik wedderhalen) Opgaven hest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:199
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:496 rc.cpp:1443
msgid "To-dos use category colors"
msgstr "Opgaven hebbt Kategorienklören"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:200
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:499 rc.cpp:1446
msgid ""
"Check this box so that to-dos will use category colors and not colors "
"specific to their due, due today or overdue state"
msgstr ""
"Maakt dit an, wenn Du Opgaven mit de Kategorienklören un nich mit Klören för "
"ehr Afloopdatum wiesen wullt"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:204
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EnableMonthScroll), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:502 rc.cpp:1449
msgid "Enable scrollbars in month view cells"
msgstr "Zell-Rullbalken binnen Maandansicht anmaken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:205
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (EnableMonthScroll), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:505 rc.cpp:1452
msgid ""
"Check this box to display scrollbars when clicking on a cell in the month "
"view; they will only appear when needed though."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du na't Klicken op en Zell in de Maandansicht Rullbalkens "
"wiest hebben wullt. Se dukt aver bloots op, wenn dat noot deit."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:209
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EnableMonthItemIcons), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:508 rc.cpp:1455
msgid "Enable icons in events in month view cells"
msgstr "Lüttbiller binnen Begeefnissen in Maandansicht-Zellen anmaken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:210
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (EnableMonthItemIcons), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:511 rc.cpp:1458
msgid ""
"Check this box to display icons (alarm, recursion, etc.) in month view cells."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Lüttbiller (Alarm, Wedderhalen usw.) binnen de Zellen "
"vun de Maandansicht wiesen wullt"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:214
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SelectionStartsEditor), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:514 rc.cpp:1461
msgid "Time range selection in agenda view starts event editor"
msgstr "Tietrebeet-Köör binnen Dagansicht start Begeefniseditor"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:215
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SelectionStartsEditor), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:517 rc.cpp:1464
msgid ""
"Check this box to start the event editor automatically when you select a "
"time range in the daily and weekly view. To select a time range, drag the "
"mouse from the start time to the end time of the event you are about to plan."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn dat Markeren vun en Tietrebeet binnen de Dag- oder "
"Weekansicht den Begeefniseditor automaatsch starten schall. Tietrebeden "
"kannst Du markeren, wenn Du bi de Anfangtiet den linken Muusknoop "
"daaldrückst un de Muus mit hollen Muusknoop na de Enntiet schuffst."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:220
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MarcusBainsEnabled), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:520 rc.cpp:1467
msgid "Show current-time (Marcus Bains) line"
msgstr "Lien för aktuelle Tiet wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:221
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MarcusBainsEnabled), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:523 rc.cpp:1470
msgid ""
"Check this box to display a red line in the day or week view indicating the "
"current-time line (Marcus Bains line)."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du de aktuelle Tiet mit en rode Lien in Dag- un "
"Weekansicht wiesen wullt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:225
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (MarcusBainsShowSeconds), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:526 rc.cpp:1473
msgid "Show seconds on current-time line"
msgstr "Sekunnen op Lien för aktuelle Tiet wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:226
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MarcusBainsShowSeconds), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:529 rc.cpp:1476
msgid "Check this box if you want to show seconds on the current-time line."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du ok de Sekunnen bi de Lien för de aktuelle Tiet wiesen "
"wullt"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:231
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:532 rc.cpp:1479
msgid "Colors used in agenda view"
msgstr "Klören för de Dagansicht"

# unreviewed-context
#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:232
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:535 rc.cpp:1482
msgid "Choose the colors of the agenda view items."
msgstr "De Klören för de Indrääg vun de Dagansicht utsöken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:235
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:538 rc.cpp:1485
msgid "Category inside, calendar outside"
msgstr "Kategorie binnen, Kalenner buten"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:238
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:541 rc.cpp:1488
msgid "Calendar inside, category outside"
msgstr "Kategorie buten, Kalenner binnen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:241
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:544 rc.cpp:1491
msgid "Only category"
msgstr "Bloots Kategorie"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:244
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:547 rc.cpp:1494
msgid "Only calendar"
msgstr "Bloots Kalenner"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:251
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AgendaViewCalendarDisplay), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:550 rc.cpp:1497
msgid "Agenda View Calendar Display"
msgstr "Dorstellen vun de Dagansicht"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:254
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AgendaViewCalendarDisplay), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:553 rc.cpp:1500
msgid "Merge all calendars into one view"
msgstr "All Kalenners binnen een Ansicht tosamenföhren"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:257
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AgendaViewCalendarDisplay), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:556 rc.cpp:1503
msgid "Show calendars side by side"
msgstr "Kalenners blangenanner wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:260
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AgendaViewCalendarDisplay), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:559 rc.cpp:1506
msgid "Switch between views with tabs"
msgstr "Paneels för Ansichten bruken"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:269
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DayBegins), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:562 rc.cpp:1509
msgid "Day begins at"
msgstr "Daganfang"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:270
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DayBegins), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:565 rc.cpp:1512
msgid ""
"Enter the start time for events here. This time should be the earliest time "
"that you use for events, as it will be displayed at the top."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier de fröhste Tiet in, de Du normalerwies för Begeefnissen bruukst, "
"se warrt baven an de Kant wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:275
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WorkingHoursStart), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:568 rc.cpp:1515
msgid "Daily starting hour"
msgstr "Arbeitanfang"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:276
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WorkingHoursStart), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:571 rc.cpp:1518
msgid ""
"Enter the start time for the working hours here. The working hours will be "
"marked with color by KOrganizer."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien Arbeitanfang in. KOrganizer markeert de Arbeitstünnen mit en "
"anner Achtergrundklöör."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:280
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WorkingHoursEnd), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:574 rc.cpp:1521
msgid "Daily ending hour"
msgstr "Arbeitenn"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:281
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WorkingHoursEnd), group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:577 rc.cpp:1524
msgid ""
"Enter the ending time for the working hours here. The working hours will be "
"marked with color by KOrganizer."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien Arbeitenn in. KOrganizer markeert de Arbeitstünnen mit en "
"anner Achtergrundklöör."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:288
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:580 rc.cpp:1527
msgid "Exclude holidays"
msgstr "Nich op Fierdaag"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:289
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:583 rc.cpp:1530
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent KOrganizer from marking the working hours on "
"holidays."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn KOrganizer de Arbeitstünnen op Fierdaag nich markeren "
"schall."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:294
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:586 rc.cpp:1533
msgid "Month view uses category colors"
msgstr "Kategorieklören binnen Maandansicht"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:295
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:589 rc.cpp:1536
msgid ""
"Check this box to make the month view use the category colors of an item."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Begeefnissen binnen de Maandansicht de Klören vun ehr "
"Kategorien hebben schöölt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:300
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:592 rc.cpp:1539
msgid "Month view uses resource colors"
msgstr "Ressourcenklören binnen Maandansicht"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:301
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:595 rc.cpp:1542
msgid ""
"Check this box to make the month view use the resource colors of an item."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Begeefnissen binnen de Maandansicht de Klören vun ehr "
"Ressourcen hebben schöölt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:306
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:598 rc.cpp:1545
msgid "Month view uses full window"
msgstr "Maandansicht bruukt heel Finster"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:307
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:601 rc.cpp:1548
msgid ""
"Check this box to use the full KOrganizer window when displaying the month "
"view. If this box is checked, you will gain some space for the monthly view, "
"but other widgets, such as the date navigator, the item details and the "
"resources list, will not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Maandansicht dat hele KOrganizer-Finster bruken "
"schall. De Maandansicht kriggt so wat mehr Platz, man anner Elementen as t."
"B. de Datumnavigatschoon, de Indragenkelheiten oder de Ressourcenlist warrt "
"nich mehr wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:311
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:604 rc.cpp:1551
msgid "To-do list view uses full window"
msgstr "Opgavenlist bruukt heel Finster"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:312
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:607 rc.cpp:1554
msgid ""
"Check this box to use the full KOrganizer window when displaying the to-do "
"list view. If this box is checked, you will gain some space for the to-do "
"list view, but other widgets, such as the date navigator, the to-do details "
"and the resources list, will not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Opgavenansicht dat hele KOrganizer-Finster bruken "
"schall. De Opgavenansicht kriggt so wat mehr Platz, man anner Elementen as t."
"B. de Datumnavigatschoon, de Opgaavenkelheiten oder de Ressourcenlist warrt "
"nich mehr wiest."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:317
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:610 rc.cpp:1557
msgid "Record completed to-dos in journal entries"
msgstr "Utföhrte Opgaven na't Daagbook indregen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:318
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:613 rc.cpp:1560
msgid ""
"Check this box to record the completion of a to-do in a new entry of your "
"journal automatically."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du dat Utföhren vun en Opgaav automaatsch in en "
"Daagbookindrag fasthollen wullt."

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:323
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Views)
#: rc.cpp:616 rc.cpp:1563
msgid "Always display completed to-dos at the bottom of the list"
msgstr "Afslaten Opgaven jümmers nerrn op de List wiesen"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:324
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Views)
